# 情境 03：V2（AES-GCM + AAD + HMAC 清單）——三種攻擊皆被偵測並拒絕（對應 T6–T8）

# --- 攻擊 1：竄改內容。GCM 的 CTR 部分可被精準翻轉，但 tag 驗證失敗
reset all
login v2 pw-v2
upload transfer.txt Transfer $0100 to Alice. Approved by Bob.
attack tamper #1 10 0100 9100
expect ok
expect contains ciphertext
cat transfer.txt
expect rejected
expect contains IntegrityError
expect not-contains $9100

# --- 攻擊 2：植入檔案。伺服器只能複製既有記錄，新 ID 不在 HMAC 清單內
reset v2
login v2 pw-v2
upload report.pdf real report
attack inject confession.txt #1
expect ok
ls
expect rejected
expect contains IntegrityError
cat #2
expect rejected
# 未被動過的原檔仍可用 ID 正常下載：偵測是精準的，不是整個壞掉
cat #1
expect ok
expect contains real report

# --- 攻擊 3：對調檔名。(file_id, 加密檔名) 配對與清單不符
reset v2
login v2 pw-v2
upload a.txt content of A
upload b.txt content of B
attack swap #1 #2
expect ok
ls
expect rejected
cat #1
expect rejected
expect not-contains content of B
